homelab-haproxy (0.1.12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Prometheus metrics: add an always-on HTTP-mode `prometheus_metrics`
    frontend (:8404/metrics) using HAProxy's built-in prometheus-exporter
    service, and advertise it as a `haproxy-metrics` fleet service
    (kind: metrics-exporter) so homelab-prometheus discovers + scrapes it.
    Port is firewalled to the monitoring host by homelab-node-exporter.

